The transcription runner mcp-server/python/fluid_speech_transcribe.py adapts
the reference transcribe.py distributed with Fluid Speech Mini by FluidVoice
(https://huggingface.co/FluidVoice-Labs/fluid-speech-mini-onnx), licensed
CC BY 4.0. Fluid Speech Mini is built on NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 and
Moondream Parakeet Ultra, both CC BY 4.0. The model weights are not shipped
in this repository; the setup wizard downloads them from Hugging Face.
